# Runtime state the suite writes into whatever project it runs against.
#
# Developing the plugin means running it against this repository, so the state
# lands here at the root. The plugin ships its own .gitignore, but that one only
# covers paths beneath it — the root needs its own or these turn up untracked
# after every test run.
#
# Session logs carry agent output. They are not artifacts to commit.
.dev-suite/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
